            "format": "html",
            "html": "<p>Yes. We start from your last reconciled month and catch up the rest, usually within three weeks.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "software",
          "question": "Which accounting software do you use?",
          "answer": {
            "format": "html",
            "html": "<p>We work in QuickBooks Online and Xero, and migrate you for free on annual plans.</p>"
